N tsg_schemes.pkg
D 31 Jul 2024
U 40
d '{bf:TSG-SCHEMES}': provides various ready-to-use Stata graph schemes.
d 
d These graph schemes are released as part of The Stata Guide (TSG) series (https://medium.com/the-stata-guide).
d Here you can install various schemes with three backgrounds: dark, white, and gg (grey). The gg schemes are similar to the ggplot2 in R.
d Majority of the schemes are derived from Stata's s2color, cleanplots (Mize 2018), and plainplot from blindschemes (Bischof 2017).
d Colors are taken from Ben Jann's colorpalette package (Jann 2018) and scripted into the scheme files.
d A sample data and dofile are provided on GitHub to test these schemes.
d 
d Schemes can defined for all graphs: 'set scheme black_tableau' or 'set scheme black_tableau, perm'.
d Schemes can also be called directly while making graphs: 'twoway (scatter y x), scheme(gg_viridis)'.
d 
d Please check https://github.com/asjadnaqvi/Stata-schemes for the latest updates. Please report errors that you find.
d 
d Requires Stata version 16 or above. Version 15 and below might result in errors due to changes in the raw scheme files.
d 
d KW: Stata
d KW: schemes
d 
d Distribution date: 28 June 2021
d 
d Author: Asjad Naqvi, WU Vienna/IIASA, Austria
d Support: asjadnaqvi@gmail.com
d 
f s\scheme-black_tableau.scheme
f s\scheme-white_tableau.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_tableau.scheme
f s\scheme-black_cividis.scheme
f s\scheme-white_cividis.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_cividis.scheme
f s\scheme-black_viridis.scheme
f s\scheme-white_viridis.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_viridis.scheme
f s\scheme-black_hue.scheme
f s\scheme-white_hue.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_hue.scheme
f s\scheme-black_brbg.scheme
f s\scheme-white_brbg.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_brbg.scheme
f s\scheme-black_piyg.scheme
f s\scheme-white_piyg.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_piyg.scheme
f s\scheme-black_ptol.scheme
f s\scheme-white_ptol.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_ptol.scheme
f s\scheme-black_jet.scheme
f s\scheme-white_jet.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_jet.scheme
f s\scheme-black_w3d.scheme
f s\scheme-white_w3d.scheme
f s\scheme-gg_w3d.scheme
