N didplacebo.pkg
D 20 Feb 2025
U 109
d 'DIDPLACEBO': module for  in-time, in-space and mixed placebo tests for estimating difference-in-differences (DID) models
d 
d      didplacebo implements placebo tests for estimating
d difference-in-differences (DID) models, where policy adoption may
d be synchronized or staggered.  In particular, didplacebo
d performs in-time placebo tests using fake treatment times,
d in-space    placebo tests using fake treatment units (randomly
d selected), and mixed placebo tests using both fake treatment
d units and    times (both randomly selected). Moreover,
d didplacebo produces convenient graphs for visualization.
d 
d KW: difference in differences
d KW: DiD
d KW: placebo
d KW: graphics
d 
d Requires: Stata version 16
