d graphical form. It is mainly intended for use with two
d categorical  variables but also has uses for plotting multiple
d histograms.  The widths of bars may be tuned to allow touching or
d underlap.  tabplot is for Stata 8.  tabplot6 is the previous
d version of tabplot written for Stata 6,  with similar but not
d identical functionality and syntax. tabplot6 requires the egen
