N bdiff.pkg
D  4 Oct 2026
U 193
d 'BDIFF': module to compute Bootstrap and Permutation tests for difference in coefficients between two groups
d 
d  bdiff perform several tests (Fisher's Permutation test;
d Seemingly Unrelated Regression test, see     suest) to determine
d the significance of observed differences in coefficient estimates
d between two  groups.    By default, bdiff performs traditional
d Fisher's permutation test (sampling without replacement) of
d differences in coefficient estimates between two groups It uses
d simulation evidence to determine the   significance of observed
d differences in coefficient estimates between two groups.  For
d general    introduction of this method, see Efron and Tibshirani
d (1993, Section 15.2, pp.202).
d 
